ission.</font></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><font style="font-size:11pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</font></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><font style="font-size:10.5pt;"><img src="pbm-20240930xex99d5003.jpg" alt="Graphic" style="display:inline-block;height:21.75pt;left:0%;padding-bottom:0.75pt;position:relative;top:0pt;width:93pt;"></font></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><font style="font-size:11pt;">Chartered Professional Accountants</font></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 16.64pt 0pt;"><font style="font-size:11pt;">Licensed Public Accountants</font></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><font style="font-size:11pt;">Burlington, Canada</font></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 5pt 0pt;"><font style="font-size:11pt;">January 23, 2025</font></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><font style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</font></p><div align="left"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;"><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:57.55%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:8pt;margin:0pt 0pt 5pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">MNP LLP</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:42.44%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 5pt 0pt;"><font style="font-size:8pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</font></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:57.55%;border-bottom:1.5pt solid